posit-disputes"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.gov.scot","ref_id":"turn3search6","snippet":"We do, however, hold data on how many referrals are made each year for dispute resolution provided by the tenancy deposit schemes in their annual","title":"Deposit Return dispute resolution referrals: FOI release","url":"https://www.gov.scot/publications/foi-202400437112/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.open-access.bcu.ac.uk","ref_id":"turn3search7","snippet":"# Adjudication in tenancy deposit scheme disputes: Agents’ perspectives ... Purpose – The purpose of this paper is to examine empirically the operation of tenancy","title":"Adjudication in tenancy deposit scheme disputes: Agents’ perspectives","url":"https://www.open-access.bcu.ac.uk/1765/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.tandfonline.com","ref_id":"turn3search8","snippet":"## Crowdsourced Online Dispute Resolution from a Chinese Perspective ... China’s largest e-commerce platform Taobao.com has been testing this innovative approach since 2012. ... This","title":"“Let the collective intelligence shine through”","url":"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/20517483.2018.1603645"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.gov.scot","ref_id":"turn3search9","snippet":"Results from research with tenants, landlords and schemes as part of a review of the Tenancy Deposit Scheme in Scotland. ... The surveys were sent","title":"Surveys of tenants and landlords","url":"https://www.gov.scot/publications/review-tenancy-deposit-schemes-scotland/pages/4/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.bschool.cuhk.edu.hk","ref_id":"turn3search10","snippet":"However, the scale of those issues invites opportunistic buyer behavior, such as filing false claims, making information provision and verification central to dispute resolution. ...","title":"Judging the Case or Judging the Buyer? Dispute Resolution on Two-sided Platforms - CUHK Business School | BBA, MBA, EMBA, and DBA","url":"https://www.bschool.cuhk.edu.hk/events/judging-